          "section": "TheWebConf 2023 Research Tracks Final Call For Papers (CFP) “Web Research with Openness, Fairness and Reproducibility”",
          "text": "TheWebConf 2023 Research Tracks Final Call For Papers (CFP) “Web Research with Openness, Fairness and Reproducibility”\nWe invite contributions to the research tracks of The Web Conference 2023 (formerly known as WWW). The conference will have a hybrid format, hosted by Austin, TX, US, on April 30 - May 4, 2023.\nInstructions for authors of research tracks submissions",
