        {
          "section": "CALL FOR PAPERS",
          "text": "CALL FOR PAPERS\nWe invite contributions to the research tracks of The Web Conference 2024 (formerly known as WWW). The conference will take place in Singapore, from May 13 to 17, 2024.\nThe Web Conference is the premier conference focused on understanding the current state and the evolution of the Web through the lens of computer science, computational social science, economics, policy, and many other disciplines.",
          "sha256": "24983545e034cfc4f0618d5502f17b377f36d0e203966b47ca6ad8417e39e65f"
        },
        {
          "section": "Important Dates",
          "text": "Important Dates\nAbstract: Thursday, October 5, 2023\nFull paper: Thursday, October 12, 2023\nAuthor and reviewer discussion: December 1-14, 2023\nNotification: February 1, 2024\nAll submission deadlines are end-of-day in the Anywhere on Earth (AoE) time zone.",
          "sha256": "88e4e23019a81e11483f432c9b7fb9977e7f761439c99a90e215833a69b351f1"
        }
      ],
      "links": [],
