      "snippets": [
        {
          "section": "CALL FOR PAPERS",
          "text": "Please ensure all authors’ profiles on OpenReview are up to date, including the correct first and last names (in English), affiliation, and a preferred/primary email address (must be contactable). Failure to provide accurate information may prevent the Publisher from contacting you, which could result in your paper not being included in the conference proceedings.\nWe invite contributions to the research tracks of The Web Conference 2025 (formerly known as WWW). The conference will take place in Sydney, Australia, from 28 April to 02 May 2025.\nThe Web Conference is the premier conference focused on understanding the current state and the evolution of the Web through the lens of computer science, computational social science, economics, policy, and many other disciplines.\nImportant Dates:\nAbstract: October 7, 2024\nFull paper: October 14, 2024\nAuthor and reviewer discussion: December 3-14, 2024\nNotification: January 20, 2025",
          "sha256": "c4853e9e85e888ae6cf9ddad9a9711222b17c9af9980b976d4a072b840dcb483"
        },
        {
          "section": "CALL FOR PAPERS",
